<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Calligraphers on Dubai Calligrapher Directory</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/</link><description>Recent content in Calligraphers on Dubai Calligrapher Directory</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>eL Seed</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/el-seed/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/el-seed/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;eL Seed uses complex Arabic calligraphy to spread messages of peace and unity, blending graffiti with traditional calligraphy in a style he calls &amp;lsquo;calligraffiti&amp;rsquo;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mattar Bin Lahej</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/mattar-bin-lahej/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/mattar-bin-lahej/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Mattar Bin Lahej is a self-taught Emirati artist, photographer, and sculptor, famous for his &amp;lsquo;Mattar Script&amp;rsquo; and large-scale calligraphy sculptures.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Narjes Noureddine</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/narjes-noureddine/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/narjes-noureddine/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Narjes Noureddine is an award-winning calligrapher who specializes in classical scripts, bringing a refined and traditional aesthetic to her work.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Nihad Taisir Nadam</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/nihad-taisir-nadam/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/nihad-taisir-nadam/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Nihad Taisir Nadam is a digital artist and designer focusing on the intersection of Arabic calligraphy and modern technology.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Wissam Shawkat</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/wissam-shawkat/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/wissam-shawkat/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Wissam Shawkat is a world-class calligrapher and designer who has developed a unique style known as Calligraformy, blending traditional forms with modern abstraction.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Featured Calligraphers</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/featured-calligraphers/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/featured-calligraphers/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Majid Alyousef</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/majid-alyousef/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/majid-alyousef/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Majid Alyousef is a master calligrapher and designer based in Dubai. He is globally recognized for his ability to transform the classical Thuluth script into avant-garde geometric compositions. His work is not merely decorative; it is a study of the mathematical beauty of the Arabic letterform.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Search Directory</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/search-directory/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/search-directory/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Suggest a Calligrapher</title><link>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/suggest-a-calligrapher/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.dubaicalligrapher.com/calligraphers/suggest-a-calligrapher/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Know a talented calligrapher based in the UAE? Let us know!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;form action="https://formspree.io/f/mnjnnzov" method="POST"&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="artist_name"&gt;Artist Name (Required)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" id="artist_name" name="artist_name" required&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="emirate"&gt;Emirate/City (Required)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" id="emirate" name="emirate" required&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="contact_link"&gt;Website or Contact Link (Required)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;input type="url" id="contact_link" name="contact_link" required&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="specialty"&gt;Specialty Type (Required)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;select id="specialty" name="specialty" required&gt;
 &lt;option value=""&gt;Select a specialty&lt;/option&gt;
 &lt;option value="Classical"&gt;Classical&lt;/option&gt;
 &lt;option value="Contemporary"&gt;Contemporary&lt;/option&gt;
 &lt;option value="Digital"&gt;Digital&lt;/option&gt;
 &lt;option value="Sculptural"&gt;Sculptural&lt;/option&gt;
 &lt;/select&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="scripts"&gt;Scripts Tags (Optional)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" id="scripts" name="scripts" placeholder="e.g., Thuluth, Naskh, Kufic"&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="your_name"&gt;Your Name (Required)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" id="your_name" name="your_name" required&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="your_email"&gt;Your Email (Required)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;input type="email" id="your_email" name="your_email" required&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="form-group"&gt;
 &lt;label for="notes"&gt;Notes (Optional)&lt;/label&gt;
 &lt;textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="3"&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" name="_gotcha" class="honeypot"&gt;
 &lt;input type="hidden" name="_next" value="/thanks/"&gt;
 &lt;button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"&gt;Submit Suggestion&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>